        <mxCell id="tTitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#534AB7;" value="Teacher：冻结 θ₀（stop-gradient，仅前向，双前向取激活差 ΔA）" vertex="1">
